          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:clear_shroud",
            side: 1,
            xs: "16-35,11-32",
            ys: "4-17,6-18",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scroll_to",
            x: 29,
            y: 14,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Chief Dra-Nak",
            text: _("You’ve been a difficult prize to capture, but well worth the cost! Human corpses may not sell as well as dwarf or drake tribute, but with this many of you, I’ll still fetch a hefty bounty."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gweddry",
            text: _("Drakes, surely you can see that this orc does not have your best interests at heart? He is bleeding your numbers to fund his empire while your leader stands by and does nothing!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("I follow the Ways of our Flight. Mortic is Aspirant. I serve his will."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Chief Dra-Nak",
            x: 27,
            y: 13,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Chief Dra-Nak",
            text: _("You Wesnothians still don’t get it? These weaklings <i>need</i> me! Before I came, this place was a wasteland, with drake, dwarf, and naga fighting over scraps and bleeding in the snow."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Chief Dra-Nak",
            text: _("I united them all under my banner, bringing <i>peace</i> and <i>order</i> to these mountains! And once I sell you off, we will have enough money and power to rival even the great tribes of the north. I will usher in a new golden age for my people!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Owaec",
            text: _("You murder your allies and call it peace? Bah, this place will only know peace once you are dead!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Owaec",
            x: 26,
            y: 14,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Chief Dra-Nak",
            text: _("Hah, that almost hurt! I’m gonna enjoy shipping you lot down south. Maybe this time, the necromancers will let me watch..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scroll_to",
            x: 20,
            y: 15,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("<small>(_Opening the cells should confuse the guards for a moment. But I better not get too close to them...)</small>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:teleport",
            id: "Chief Dra-Nak",
            x: 30,
            y: 15,
            to_x: 29,
            to_y: 14,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
